ent__K5K7M"><header><h1>Maximum Subarray Sum</h1></header><div class=3D"sty=
le_problemDescription__T4cPe"><p>Given an array of integers, return the <co=
de>sum</code> of the subarray with the <strong>largest sum</strong>.</p><h4=
 id=3D"example">Example:</h4><pre><code class=3D"hljs language-python">Inpu=
t: nums =3D [<span class=3D"hljs-number">3</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-numb=
