<p>When we reach index 2, we land on the first negative number (-6). Adding=
 it to the current sum gives us a negative sum of -2.</p>
<p>What should we do now? If we restart the subarray at this point, the new=
 subarray will start with a sum of -6, which is less than the current sum o=
f -2.</p>
